        "created_at": "2017-01-12T19:38:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Hey, Paul--</span></p><p>Is the crew going Origins actively looking at new designs? &nbsp;I have two board game prototypes that I think would be a good fit for &gt;G, one as a Dice Hate Me Rabbit title, and another as a bigger-box flagship design.</p><p>If so, could we look at setting up a time to meet? &nbsp;PM me, if you would like.</p><p>Cheers!</p>",
