        "created_at": "2017-01-15T19:39:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@Paul -- I hadn't planned on doing GenCon this year, as we have a friend's wedding in August, and the trip to Minneapolis eats the budget that we would normally set aside for GenCon. &nbsp;I have every morning free at Origins, though, and all day on Sunday. &nbsp;If there's a time available--even a lunch meeting, over at North Market--I'd love to set something up!</p>",
